<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 16.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 16.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, June 16:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,683.40 (1,677.30)	CHF  1,166.20 (1,160.90)</p>
<p>    DEM    972.84 (972.91)	  GBP  2,749.80 (2,737.90)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.26 (138.33)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $34.01 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$17.60 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $51.61 million ($25.24 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
